  "notes": [
    "3,021 classes from 221 content modules / 130,273 triples. (The original hand analysis counted 286 files / 132,414 triples by also parsing the About*/Metadata* aggregators, which carry only owl:imports; the ingester excludes them.)",
    "219 SEC Preferred* share classes collapsed into flags on FinancialInstrument (SUBCLASS_COLLAPSE).",
    "InstrumentType is the TAXONOMY_SIDECAR for the 12-level class tree.",
    "External imports NOT vendored: 1,193 to OMG Commons, 54 to LCC (IMPORT_RESOLVE).",
    "Canvas positions are curated (domain-banded), not grid-generated.",
    "Timestamps are declared DATETIME; the TYPE_MAP rule negotiates them to STRING (ISO 8601) for targets whose Neo4jType enum lacks DATETIME."
  ],
